---
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
---
<SiteLayout title="Terms of Use | AutoPet" description="Terms for using AutoPet's informational pet product reviews and buying guides.">
  <article class="page">
    <p class="eyebrow">Please read before using this site</p>
    <h1>Terms of use</h1>
    <p>AutoPet provides general product information for educational purposes. We make reasonable efforts to keep guides useful and accurate, but product details, prices, availability, and features can change. Confirm important information with the manufacturer or retailer.</p>
    <h2>Not veterinary advice</h2>
    <p>Content on this site is not veterinary, medical, or other professional advice. For questions about your pet's health, diet, behavior, or safety, consult a qualified veterinarian.</p>
    <h2>Third-party retailers</h2>
    <p>Links may take you to third-party websites. AutoPet is not responsible for their content, policies, transactions, or products. Purchases are subject to the retailer's terms.</p>
    <h2>Use of content</h2>
    <p>Content is provided as-is, without warranties to the extent permitted by law. You may link to our pages; do not republish substantial content without permission.</p>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions about these terms? Email <a href="mailto:hello@autopet.store">hello@autopet.store</a>.</p>
  </article>
</SiteLayout>
<style>
  .page { width: min(760px, calc(100% - 2rem)); margin: auto; padding-block: 3rem; }
  .eyebrow { color: var(--teal); font-weight: 750; }
  h2 { margin-top: 2rem; font-size: 1.5rem; }
</style>
